  unitName: Fire Princess Lyn
  unitId: 10302
  unitNumber: 345
  description: A member of a magical clan captured by the Agni Empire, Lyn manipulated
    a great fire strong enough to melt iron. Defeated by a high ranking priest, she
    had most of her powers sealed and was jailed. When the war with the gods began,
    she escaped. Unable to undo the seal, she vented her fury with what little magic
    she had, indiscriminately thrashing both humans and gods.
  summonDesc: You're a Summoner?<br>You need me even in my present state?<br>Let's
    wreak havoc together?
  fusionDesc: Oh! You want to give me power?<br>You're a strange one!
